{
  "_schema": "phantasie.graphics-pack/v1",
  "_note": "Commodore 64 Phantasie II art (v1.2; the p2-c64 import, P2C64Art; reverse-engineering/c64/phantasie2/GRAPHICS.md). C64 I's engine: FONT+HER, HSPRIT and the item pictures are I's byte for byte. Monsters are the MX n sprite bands of side 1 (one figure: the band's first sprites, expanded as the VIC does); portraits the HSPRIT pair of each race (none for UNDEAD); the title PIC.* (multicolour bitmap, doubled pixels); town.backdrop the town screen's six buildings at their places (FONT+HER's town characters); the map from II's FONT characters as II's UTIL-3.O routine prints them. Colours: Colodore (VICE colodore.vpl). Text: the remaster 5x7 font (the C64's sets are in font/). Not drawn: the item / feature pictures (items/; the Client has no such slot), the ending (PH2.END-4, TLUM1) and the party-wipe screen (CEMETARY2's files).",
